DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T100000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260918T110000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Michael Peter Edson - Human Agency & Machine Inquiry
DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher
  education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\
 , but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities
  for research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depend
 s entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.Michael Peter Edson is a dir
 ector\, founder\, and strategist working at the intersection of tech\, cu
 lture\, and democracy.Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks w
 ebsite. (https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  As generative AI becomes embedded acros
 s disciplines\, higher education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle b
 etween opposing camps\, but of intentional design.</p><p>  Generative sys
 tems offer novel capabilities for research\, creation\, and learning\, ye
 t their ultimate value depends entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them
 .</p><p><strong>Michael Peter Edson</strong> is a director\, founder\, an
 d strategist working at the intersection of tech\, culture\, and democrac
 y.</p><p><a href="https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026" target="_blank"
  rel="noopener">Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website
 .</a></p>
