X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T110000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261002T120000
LOCATION:Online
SUMMARY:Z (Changying) Zheng - Human Agency & Machine Inquiry
DESCRIPTION:As generative AI becomes embedded across disciplines\, higher
  education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle between opposing camps\
 , but of intentional design.  Generative systems offer novel capabilities
  for research\, creation\, and learning\, yet their ultimate value depend
 s entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them.ZZheng works at the intersec
 tion of operations\, design\, and AI\, helping organizations scale throug
 h better systems\, stronger alignment\, and more effective teams.Learn mo
 re on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website. (https://cs.santarosa.
 edu/ai-talks-2026)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  As generative AI becomes embedded acros
 s disciplines\, higher education faces a pivotal moment—not of battle b
 etween opposing camps\, but of intentional design.</p><p>  Generative sys
 tems offer novel capabilities for research\, creation\, and learning\, ye
 t their ultimate value depends entirely on how thoughtfully we guide them
 .</p><p><strong>Z</strong><strong>Zheng</strong> works at the intersectio
 n of operations\, design\, and AI\, helping organizations scale through b
 etter systems\, stronger alignment\, and more effective teams.</p><p><a h
 ref="https://cs.santarosa.edu/ai-talks-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopene
 r">Learn more on the SRJC Computer Studies' AI Talks website.</a></p>
