DESCRIPTION:Give the gift of life at the SRJC Blood Drive\, hosted in par
 tnership with the American Red Cross. Blood donations are especially impo
 rtant for patients with sickle cell disease\, who may require multiple tr
 ansfusions and can benefit from closely matched blood donations.  Every d
 onation can help save lives.For more information\, visit the SRJC Student
  Health Services website. (https://shs.santarosa.edu/10-6-2026-blood-driv
 e)
