  Drive\, hosted in partnership with the American Red Cross. Blood donatio
 ns are especially important for patients with sickle cell disease\, who m
 ay require multiple transfusions and can benefit from closely matched blo
 od donations.</p><p>  Every donation can help save lives.</p><p><a href="
 https://shs.santarosa.edu/10-6-2026-blood-drive" target="_blank" rel="noo
 pener">For more information\, visit the SRJC Student Health Services webs
 ite.</a></p>
