BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T193000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261007T220000
LOCATION:Burbank Auditorium - Santa Rosa Campus
SUMMARY:Stars\, Legends & Fantasy - Symphonic Band & Jazz Band
DESCRIPTION:SRJC Symphonic Band\, Jazz Band\, and the Santa Rosa High Sch
 ool Band invite audiences on a musical journey through stars\, legends\, 
 and fantasy.  The SRJC Symphonic Band explores the magic and mystery of t
 he imagination through music including The Sorcerer's Apprentice\, famous
 ly featured in Disney's Fantasia\; Starry Ocean\, inspired by the vastnes
 s and wonder of the night sky\; and the night-evoking Incantation and Dan
 ce.  The SRJC Jazz Band brings its own take on fantasy and imagination wi
 th Gates of Tashbaan from The Chronicles of Narnia\, the jazz classic Ste
 lla by Starlight\, and Pure Imagination from Willy Wonka.  Guest ensemble
  Santa Rosa High School Symphonic Band joins the performance\, culminatin
 g in a special joint-ensemble finale with SRJC.  &#160\;For more informat
 ion and tickets\, visit the SRJC Music Events website. (https://music.san
 tarosa.edu/events)&#160\;
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  SRJC Symphonic Band\, Jazz Band\, and t
 he Santa Rosa High School Band invite audiences on a musical journey thro
 ugh stars\, legends\, and fantasy.</p><p>  The SRJC Symphonic Band explor
 es the magic and mystery of the imagination through music including <stro
 ng>The Sorcerer's Apprentice</strong>\, famously featured in Disney's <em
 >Fantasia</em>\; <strong>Starry Ocean</strong>\, inspired by the vastness
  and wonder of the night sky\; and the night-evoking <strong>Incantation 
 and Dance</strong>.</p><p>  The SRJC Jazz Band brings its own take on fan
 tasy and imagination with <strong>Gates of Tashbaan</strong> from <em>The
  Chronicles of Narnia</em>\, the jazz classic <strong>Stella by Starlight
 </strong>\, and <strong>Pure Imagination</strong> from <em>Willy Wonka</e
 m>.</p><p>  Guest ensemble <strong>Santa Rosa High School Symphonic Band<
 /strong> joins the performance\, culminating in a special joint-ensemble 
 finale with SRJC.</p><p>  &#160\;</p><p><a href="https://music.santarosa.
 edu/events" target="_blank" rel="noopener">For more information and ticke
 ts\, visit the SRJC Music Events website.</a>&#160\;</p>
