X-SOURCE:Santa Rosa Junior College
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261027T130000
LOCATION:Student Health Services\, Bertolini Student Center - Santa Rosa 
 Campus
SUMMARY:Narcan and Harm Reduction
DESCRIPTION:Learn how to recognize and respond to an opioid overdose and 
 how to use Narcan® (naloxone) to potentially save a life. This workshop 
 also introduces harm reduction strategies that can help reduce the risks 
 associated with substance use and promote safety and well-being.To regist
 er visit the Student Health Services website. (https://shs.santarosa.edu/
 10-27-26-narcan)
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  Learn how to recognize and respond to a
 n opioid overdose and how to use Narcan® (naloxone) to potentially save 
 a life. This workshop also introduces harm reduction strategies that can 
 help reduce the risks associated with substance use and promote safety an
 d well-being.</p><p><a href="https://shs.santarosa.edu/10-27-26-narcan" t
 arget="_blank" rel="noopener">To register visit the Student Health Servic
 es website.</a></p>
