 er and Academic Pathway\, connect and hear from professionals who work in
  the areas of study within the Vision &amp\; Expression pathway\, learn a
 bout opportunities to work within your area of study\, and find out about
  steps you can take now to start building your experience in your field o
 f study.SRJC Petaluma Student Engagement &amp\; Success Center: Mike Smit
 h Hall\, Building 500\, Room 114For more information\, visit our Petaluma
 Student Success Events &amp\; Workshops website here.  &#160\;  Career &a
 mp\; Academic Pathway Career Night - Vision &amp\; Expression  6-8pm Stud
 ent Engagement &amp\; Success Center\, Mike Smith Hall\, Building 500\, R
 oom 114
